---
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout title="About Us" description="Learn about Math Solution & Exam Center Mymensingh - Our mission, vision, and dedicated team since 2015">

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden gradient-bg py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-80 h-80 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-80 h-80 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]">
      <svg class="w-full h-full" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none">
        <defs>
          <pattern id="about-grid" width="10" height="10" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <path d="M 10 0 L 0 0 0 10" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.5"/>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(#about-grid)"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <span class="inline-block bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm text-white/90 text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full mb-6">Who We Are</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-6">About Us</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Discover the story behind Mymensingh's premier mathematics coaching center
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission & Vision -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="card-glass p-10 group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl gradient-bg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-primary-500/25">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
            To empower students with a deep understanding of mathematics through innovative teaching methods, personalized attention, and a supportive learning environment. We strive to make math accessible, enjoyable, and a gateway to academic excellence for every student in Mymensingh.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-glass p-10 group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-500 to-secondary-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-secondary-500/25">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4">Our Vision</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
            To be the leading mathematics coaching center in Bangladesh, recognized for producing confident, analytical, and creative problem-solvers. We envision a future where every student sees mathematics not as a challenge, but as an exciting opportunity to grow and succeed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="inline-block text-primary-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Our Story</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">
            A Decade of <span class="gradient-text">Mathematical Excellence</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed text-lg">
            <p>
              Founded in 2015, Math Solution & Exam Center Mymensingh began with a simple yet powerful vision: to transform the way students learn and perceive mathematics. What started as a small coaching center with just 30 students has now grown into one of the most trusted educational institutions in the region.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our founder, a passionate mathematics educator, recognized that many students struggled not because they lacked talent, but because they lacked the right guidance and environment. This insight became the cornerstone of our teaching philosophy — personalized learning, conceptual clarity, and continuous practice.
            </p>
            <p>
              Over the past decade, we have helped thousands of students achieve outstanding results in their SSC, HSC, and admission exams. Our alumni have gone on to study at top universities across Bangladesh and abroad, carrying with them the problem-solving skills and confidence they built here.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="card-glass p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-primary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-40 h-40 bg-secondary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
            <div class="relative grid grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold gradient-text mb-2">2015</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Founded</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold gradient-text mb-2">500+</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Students</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold gradient-text mb-2">95%</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Success Rate</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold gradient-text mb-2">10+</div>
                <div class="text-slate-500 font-medium">Years Legacy</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose Us -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="inline-block text-primary-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Why Choose Us</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          What Makes Us <span class="gradient-text">Different</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-4 text-lg">Six reasons students and parents trust Math Academy</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="card p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl gradient-bg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-primary-500/25">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Expert Faculty</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Our teachers are highly qualified educators with years of experience in teaching mathematics at all levels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-500 to-secondary-700 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-secondary-500/25">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Small Batch Sizes</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">We maintain small class sizes to ensure every student receives individual attention and can ask questions freely.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-cyan-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-accent-500/25">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Regular Exams</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Weekly and monthly assessments with detailed feedback help students track progress and improve continuously.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-success-500 to-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-success-500/25">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Proven Materials</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Comprehensive study materials, model tests, and practice sets designed by experienced educators for optimal learning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/25">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Result Guarantee</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">Our structured approach and dedicated support have consistently delivered outstanding results year after year.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500 to-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform shadow-lg shadow-pink-500/25">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Supportive Environment</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">A welcoming, motivating atmosphere where students feel encouraged to ask questions, make mistakes, and grow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Team -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="inline-block text-primary-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Our Team</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          Meet Our <span class="gradient-text">Expert Teachers</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-4 text-lg">Dedicated educators committed to your success</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="card p-8 text-center group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full gradient-bg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-xl shadow-primary-500/20">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Md. Rafiqul Islam</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-600 font-semibold text-sm mb-3">Head of Mathematics</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">15+ years of experience in teaching advanced mathematics for SSC & HSC levels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-500 to-secondary-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-xl shadow-secondary-500/20">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Fatema Begum</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 font-semibold text-sm mb-3">Senior Mathematics Teacher</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Specializes in building strong foundational concepts for grades 5-8 students.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-500 to-cyan-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-xl shadow-accent-500/20">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Abdul Karim</h3>
          <p class="text-accent-600 font-semibold text-sm mb-3">Admission Test Specialist</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert in university admission preparation with an impressive track record of success.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-8 text-center group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-success-500 to-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform shadow-xl shadow-success-500/20">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Nusrat Jahan</h3>
          <p class="text-success-600 font-semibold text-sm mb-3">Mathematics Instructor</p>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Passionate about making math fun and accessible for students of all learning levels.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Map Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-slate-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block text-primary-600 font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Find Us</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">
          Visit Our <span class="gradient-text">Location</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 mt-4 text-lg">Conveniently located in the heart of Mymensingh</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-200">
        <div class="bg-slate-200 h-96 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center">
            <svg class="w-16 h-16 text-slate-400 mx-auto mb-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-slate-500 font-semibold text-lg">Google Maps Embed</p>
            <p class="text-slate-400 mt-2">Station Road, Mymensingh, Bangladesh</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">
        <div class="card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl gradient-bg flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/>
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Address</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Station Road, Mymensingh</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-500 to-secondary-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Hours</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">Sat-Thu: 9AM - 9PM</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-6 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-success-500 to-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Phone</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm">+880 1XXX-XXXXXX</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="section-padding gradient-bg relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-64 h-64 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">Join Our Mathematical Family</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/80 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Experience the difference that dedicated teaching and personalized attention can make. Start your journey with us today.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/admission" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-primary-700 px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          Enroll Now
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-2 border-white/30 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-200">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          Contact Us
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PublicLayout>
